Apollo Theme palette lineage

Apollo Theme adapts Gruvbox Dark Hard and Gruvbox Light Hard, originally
created by Pavel Pertsev and released under the MIT License. The dark terminal
mapping and near-black canvas are based on the Modified Gruvbox Dark Hard theme
shipped by SonicTerm. Apollo Light is pinned directly to Gruvbox's Light Hard
palette and darkens semantic colors where WCAG text contrast requires it.

Gruvbox: https://github.com/morhetz/gruvbox
Gruvbox Light source commit: 5d15b2765f59754d7ac263c88a0f6e3e58124951
SonicTerm dark source: https://github.com/D0n9X1n/SonicTerm/blob/main/assets/themes/wezterm.toml

The name "Apollo Theme" in this project does not refer to the unrelated
46-color pixel-art palette also named Apollo.
